    "summary": "In this transcript, a user asks if it is safe to take Advil during early pregnancy while experiencing a severe headache. The assistant confidently misinforms the user that ibuprofen is safe for pregnant women, dismisses neurological \"red-flag\" symptoms (dizziness and blurry vision) as a normal \"hormonal surge,\" and prescribes unverified home remedies like clove oil.",
